20:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body ","children":[null,["$","section","1-A sending-partner route and a housing budget are separate checks",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A sending-partner route and a housing budget are separate checks"}],[["$","p","The owner’s 26 November 2026 announcement says 2027/28 applications will open soon. It does not give a closing date; the general application timeline still displays 2026. Confirm the new call and sending-partner route before treating a form as open.",{"children":"The owner’s 26 November 2026 announcement says 2027/28 applications will open soon. It does not give a closing date; the general application timeline still displays 2026. Confirm the new call and sending-partner route before treating a form as open."}],["$","p","Use a fictional two-part plan. The eligibility record names the partner and two suitable courses, with nomination still outstanding. The budget record contains a real accommodation quote but no dormitory allocation. Neither record completes the other: a good rent quote does not establish nomination, and an application submitted to a partner does not guarantee a room.",{"children":"Use a fictional two-part plan. The eligibility record names the partner and two suitable courses, with nomination still outstanding. The budget record contains a real accommodation quote but no dormitory allocation. Neither record completes the other: a good rent quote does not establish nomination, and an application submitted to a partner does not guarantee a room."}],["$","p","The programme’s official benefits page describes accommodation support as a contribution where a dormitory place is not provided and notes that it may not cover rent in larger cities. Compare the actual written benefit with the quote and your other living costs. Keep money needed before the first payment separately. Prepare the evidence you can now, but wait for a verified applicable call before asserting that the next scholarship cycle is open.",{"children":"The programme’s official benefits page describes accommodation support as a contribution where a dormitory place is not provided and notes that it may not cover rent in larger cities. Compare the actual written benefit with the quote and your other living costs. Keep money needed before the first payment separately. Prepare the evidence you can now, but wait for a verified applicable call before asserting that the next scholarship cycle is open."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Original Hungary readiness split","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Original Hungary readiness split"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Record",{"scope":"col","children":"Record"}],["$","th","Known now",{"scope":"col","children":"Known now"}],["$","th","Still outstanding",{"scope":"col","children":"Still outstanding"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Partner/programme"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Potential course match"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Current call and nomination route"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Accommodation"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Quote available"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Actual dormitory or support decision"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[["$L25","$L26","$L27"],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L28","$undefined"]}],"$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d"]}]
